      "content": "it's not just pressure though. it's like... there's nothing left to give. i try to do the things, i try to be the person i'm \"supposed\" to be, but it feels so heavy. everything is just so heavy. i feel like i'm just taking up space and making things harder for everyone else by even trying to exist. it feels like it would be so much easier if i could just... stop. like, just be still for good.",
